    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/5b8bfae49cc921eb32fd34ed43eb61c8.avif?t=1755525129\" width=616 height=205 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive. Lead. Become.</strong><br>Embark on an epic journey as Kiipluu, a young hunter cast into a world of wild beauty and deadly conflict. In this narrative PC  adventure, you must navigate tribal rivalries, ancient spirits, and the unforgiving wilderness as you strive to return home. Guided by your choices, will Kiipluu prove worthy of his father\u2019s legacy or succumb to the pressures of destiny?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Epic Neolithic Adventure Awaits</strong><br>Explore a richly crafted world where nature and mysticism collide. From verdant forests alive with wildlife to volcanic landscapes brimming with danger, Kiipluu\u2019s path home is fraught with peril and wonder. When disaster strikes, you must draw upon courage, cunning, and compassion to lead your tribe through their darkest hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/bca9b48369b5cd3c94b4d21fea1c9b69.avif?t=1755525129\" width=1600 height=548 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Personal Tale of Growth and Legacy:\u00a0</strong>Experience Kiipluu\u2019s transformation from a hesitant youth to a leader burdened with the weight of his tribe\u2019s future</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visceral Combat and Stealth</strong>: Master a dynamic mix of melee, ranged, and stealth combat against rival tribes and nature\u2019s fiercest predators.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moral Dilemmas with Real Impact</strong>: Face choices that ripple through your tribe\u2019s future, affecting relationships, resources, and even lives.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunting and Crafting Systems</strong>: Hunt prey, gather materials, and craft elements essential for survival.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World of Myth and Spirit</strong>: Encounter rival tribes, ancient totems, and the spirits of the land, each woven into a narrative rich with mysticism and cultural detail.</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/5b8bfae49cc921eb32fd34ed43eb61c8.avif?t=1755525129\" width=616 height=205 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Survive. Lead. Become.</strong><br>Embark on an epic journey as Kiipluu, a young hunter cast into a world of wild beauty and deadly conflict. In this narrative PC  adventure, you must navigate tribal rivalries, ancient spirits, and the unforgiving wilderness as you strive to return home. Guided by your choices, will Kiipluu prove worthy of his father\u2019s legacy or succumb to the pressures of destiny?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>An Epic Neolithic Adventure Awaits</strong><br>Explore a richly crafted world where nature and mysticism collide. From verdant forests alive with wildlife to volcanic landscapes brimming with danger, Kiipluu\u2019s path home is fraught with peril and wonder. When disaster strikes, you must draw upon courage, cunning, and compassion to lead your tribe through their darkest hour.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3826710/extras/bca9b48369b5cd3c94b4d21fea1c9b69.avif?t=1755525129\" width=1600 height=548 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Personal Tale of Growth and Legacy:\u00a0</strong>Experience Kiipluu\u2019s transformation from a hesitant youth to a leader burdened with the weight of his tribe\u2019s future</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Visceral Combat and Stealth</strong>: Master a dynamic mix of melee, ranged, and stealth combat against rival tribes and nature\u2019s fiercest predators.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Moral Dilemmas with Real Impact</strong>: Face choices that ripple through your tribe\u2019s future, affecting relationships, resources, and even lives.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hunting and Crafting Systems</strong>: Hunt prey, gather materials, and craft elements essential for survival.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A World of Myth and Spirit</strong>: Encounter rival tribes, ancient totems, and the spirits of the land, each woven into a narrative rich with mysticism and cultural detail.</p></li></ul>",
    "short_description": "Can You Forge a Legacy? Immerse yourself in an untamed Neolithic world as Kiipluu, a young hunter on the brink of adulthood. With his tribe\u2019s survival and legacy at stake, every decision matters. Will Kiipluu rise as a leader, or will the weight of his choices break him?",
